00:42:51.242 --> 00:42:53.672 align:middle line:90%
It's the new Russian level--

00:42:53.672 --> 00:42:54.644 align:middle line:90%
AUDIENCE: [UNINTELLIGIBLE]

00:42:54.644 --> 00:42:55.894 align:middle line:84%
AUDIENCE: From Modern
Warfare 2.

00:42:55.894 --> 00:42:58.758 align:middle line:90%


00:42:58.758 --> 00:43:02.880 align:middle line:84%
