00:43:07.990 --> 00:43:09.890 align:middle line:90%
You did not have to play it.

00:43:09.890 --> 00:43:13.520 align:middle line:84%
And of course it caused a big
storm when it was released.

00:43:13.520 --> 00:43:15.973 align:middle line:84%
I'm just going to play it and
then we can talk about it

00:43:15.973 --> 00:43:17.817 align:middle line:90%
