00:43:17.817 --> 00:43:19.360 align:middle line:90%
Has anyone played this?

00:43:19.360 --> 00:43:21.334 align:middle line:90%
AUDIENCE: Yeah.

00:43:21.334 --> 00:43:25.318 align:middle line:84%
GUEST SPEAKER: Want to provide
a little context or explain

00:43:25.318 --> 00:43:28.306 align:middle line:90%
the a little bit more?

00:43:28.306 --> 00:43:32.690 align:middle line:84%
AUDIENCE: So the convoluted plot
is that this is a false

00:43:32.690 --> 00:43:36.850 align:middle line:84%
flag attack, which is staged by
a terrorist organization,

00:43:36.850 --> 00:43:40.590 align:middle line:84%
