CIA to start a war between

00:43:40.590 --> 00:43:42.620 align:middle line:90%
Russia and the US.

00:43:42.620 --> 00:43:46.200 align:middle line:84%
And so the idea here is that
you are playing a character

00:43:46.200 --> 00:43:49.740 align:middle line:84%
who is undercover as part of
the CIA who is part of this

00:43:49.740 --> 00:43:51.710 align:middle line:90%
terrorist organization.

00:43:51.710 --> 00:43:55.240 align:middle line:84%
And then you end up being double
crossed because they,

00:43:55.240 --> 00:43:57.799 align:middle line:84%
as it was just revealed at the
end, they knew you were a CIA

00:43:57.799 --> 00:44:00.620 align:middle line:84%
