pin the attack on America.

00:44:00.620 --> 00:44:03.160 align:middle line:90%


00:44:03.160 --> 00:44:04.250 align:middle line:90%
So that's the--

00:44:04.250 --> 00:44:06.000 align:middle line:84%
AUDIENCE: Do you have the option
[INTERPOSING VOICES]

00:44:06.000 --> 00:44:08.370 align:middle line:84%
