00:44:26.950 --> 00:44:28.330 align:middle line:84%
AUDIENCE: Before he's supposed
to shoot you later.

00:44:28.330 --> 00:44:28.977 align:middle line:84%
AUDIENCE: Before he's
supposed to shoot

00:44:28.977 --> 00:44:30.364 align:middle line:90%
