00:44:38.950 --> 00:44:39.875 align:middle line:90%
AUDIENCE: Yeah, there's--

00:44:39.875 --> 00:44:41.855 align:middle line:84%
AUDIENCE: If you don't shoot
the cops then you can't

00:44:41.855 --> 00:44:42.350 align:middle line:90%
