00:44:42.350 --> 00:44:44.330 align:middle line:84%
GUEST SPEAKER: Yeah
that's true.

00:44:44.330 --> 00:44:45.580 align:middle line:90%
[INAUDIBLE]

00:44:45.580 --> 00:44:49.280 align:middle line:90%


00:44:49.280 --> 00:44:52.710 align:middle line:84%
