00:45:21.263 --> 00:45:22.742 align:middle line:90%
GUEST SPEAKER: He's thorough.

00:45:22.742 --> 00:45:26.200 align:middle line:90%
He's very thorough.

00:45:26.200 --> 00:45:28.110 align:middle line:84%
But it is also interesting
