00:45:43.880 --> 00:45:48.056 align:middle line:84%
Call of Duty, has anyone
played Black Ops?

00:45:48.056 --> 00:45:49.340 align:middle line:90%
AUDIENCE: Not yet.

00:45:49.340 --> 00:45:53.250 align:middle line:84%
GUEST SPEAKER: There's a scene
